      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Verify the specific carrier sensor data to confirm exactly when and if impact was detected during transit. If the data shows the vase was healthy upon arrival, politely present this evidence to the customer while offering a small goodwill discount to preserve their relationship without issuing a full refund.",
